      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry to back things up, but this sounds like then the minimum operating power for that board is defined incorrectly?\n\nPer the spec, the minimum operating power is:\n\u003e *The Minimum Operating Power field in the Request Message Shall be set to the lowest current the Sink requires to\nmaintain operation.*",
